# The auklet: puffin's own bird, in profile.
#
# A stencil of ROLES, not colours: a colourway binds them when the sprite
# is drawn, so this art takes any theme there is, including ones written
# after it. The characters are the eleven-role alphabet; a dot is
# transparent.
#
# The files in this directory are numbered in VIEW order, from profile to
# head-on, so stepping through them is a pan.

